    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sale of two bedroom apartment on third floor in most convenient and central location.\r\n\r\nThis lovely apartment is located in the heart of Arklow town close to all town amenities, local shops, supermarkets, restaurants, leisure facilities, schools, harbour and public transport, bus and rail on your doorstep. Ideal for commuters with allocated parking space. \r\n\r\nThis third-floor apartment is very well presented, lovely interior décor in good order throughout. Hall, living room, Kitchen/Dining, two bedrooms and bathroom. \r\n\r\nIDEAL FOR SOMEONE LOOKING TO GET ON THE PROPERTY LADDER AND INVESTORS ALIKE. IDEAL LOCATION IN TOWN CENTRE."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALL \r\n2.54m x 1.03m\r\nCarpet to floor.\r\n\r\nHALL TO BEDROOM \r\n3.80m x 0.97m\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM \r\n4.53m x 2.65m\r\nNice bright room with carpet to floor.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN / DINING AREA \r\n3.69m / 2.92m\r\nWith fitted units at wall and floor level, single drainer unit, integrated electric oven and hob, fitted fridge, plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 \r\n4.34m x 2.41m  \r\nCarpet to floor.                                                                                                         \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 \r\n3.65m x 3.16m\r\nLaminated floor, bright room. Two windows to garden.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM \r\n2.67m x 1.89m  \r\nComprising bath with shower door and telephone shower, wc and whb. Airing cupboard and dual immersion heater. \r\n\r\nServices: Mains electricity, water and sewage. Electric heating. Fibre optic internet available in the area.\r\n\r\nThe service charge for apartment 16 St. Mary's Court is €1,684.00 per annum."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Central location\r\nHigh ceiling\r\nWalking distance to Arklow Main Street with all amenities close by. \r\nBus and rail service on your door step"
      },
